---
title: Resume
picture: presses
layout: layouts/page.njk
description: The resume of Romit Raj Sahu.
---
{#- One card, without a number or a title: a few words, a link that opens the resume in the browser (src/assets/files/resume.pdf, published at /resume.pdf) and a button that downloads it. Its words are in _data/pages.json ("resume"). Both load the PDF the ordinary way (data-taxi-ignore), not as a page change. -#}
<div class="page-grid" data-part="cards">
  <section class="panel page-grid__main" data-part="card">
    <div class="panel__text">
      {%- for paragraph in pages.resume.paragraphs %}
      <p>{{ paragraph | fill | safe }}</p>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="panel__actions">
      <a class="link panel__action" href="{{ downloads.resume }}" data-taxi-ignore>{{ pages.resume.link }}<span class="link__arrow" aria-hidden="true">&nearr;</span></a>
      <a class="button" href="{{ downloads.resume }}" download data-taxi-ignore>{{ pages.resume.download }}</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
